//! The `background-origin` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property sets the
//! background's origin: from the border start, inside the border, or inside the padding.
//!
//! Initial: padding-box. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Keyword effects:
//! - border-box: The background is positioned relative to the border box.
//! - content-box: The background is positioned relative to the content box.
//! - padding-box: The background is positioned relative to the padding box. Default value.
//!
